{"2844350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cosmic Horror Tales: Roots Below", "steam_appid": 2844350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844350/extras/03c8f081cfbab01b752231407cecc7e3.avif?t=1761702017\" width=620 height=256 /></span><br><br>In this top-down action RPG you will take on the role of Henry, a farmer who leaves home at night to save one of his prized lost chickens, leading you deeper and deeper into a story full of unspeakable horrors.<br><br>It's up to you to correctly guide Henry to save the chicken from him, avoiding falling into madness while he tries.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844350/extras/620d609de1ab32c79e36a83c622deb7f.avif?t=1761702017\" width=620 height=192 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Control the on and off of your flashlight to prevent dangers and find clues.<br></li><li> Manage your resources, your character's physical and mental health will be at constant risk.<br></li><li> Immerse yourself in Arcton, a mining town from the mid-19th century.<br></li><li> Solve puzzles while discovering the history of the town.<br></li><li> Written, drawn and coded by Moss Tower. The soundtrack is by Arin Eakins.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844350/extras/f19d747a6059bdf5cc00c076bc7851ac.apng?t=1761702017\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844350/extras/f19d747a6059bdf5cc00c076bc7851ac.poster.avif?t=1761702017\" class=\"bb_img\" width=528 height=192 /></picture></span>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844350/extras/03c8f081cfbab01b752231407cecc7e3.avif?t=1761702017\" width=620 height=256 /></span><br><br>In this top-down action RPG you will take on the role of Henry, a farmer who leaves home at night to save one of his prized lost chickens, leading you deeper and deeper into a story full of unspeakable horrors.<br><br>It's up to you to correctly guide Henry to save the chicken from him, avoiding falling into madness while he tries.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844350/extras/620d609de1ab32c79e36a83c622deb7f.avif?t=1761702017\" width=620 height=192 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Control the on and off of your flashlight to prevent dangers and find clues.<br></li><li> Manage your resources, your character's physical and mental health will be at constant risk.<br></li><li> Immerse yourself in Arcton, a mining town from the mid-19th century.<br></li><li> Solve puzzles while discovering the history of the town.<br></li><li> Written, drawn and coded by Moss Tower. The soundtrack is by Arin Eakins.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844350/extras/f19d747a6059bdf5cc00c076bc7851ac.apng?t=1761702017\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844350/extras/f19d747a6059bdf5cc00c076bc7851ac.poster.avif?t=1761702017\" class=\"bb_img\" width=528 height=192 /></picture></span>", "short_description": "A top-down action RPG about a farmer searching for his chicken on the edge of a town filled with horrors beyond human comprehension.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America", "reviews": "“An intriguing game with a great setting and excellent 2D top-down visuals that manage to elicit a surprising amount of dread.”<br>Alpha Beta Gamer<br><br>“A very interesting game with Lovecraftian touches, and a setting and music that